items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_HealingBreath.name = Rune: Healing Breath
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_HealingBreath.description = 6-block, 60° cone in front of you: +20 HP and 4 HP/s regeneration for 5 s to each player hit, yourself included. Initiate rune (Swampland). 35 mana, 10 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_HealingWell.name = Rune: Healing Well
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_HealingWell.description = 4-block radius zone at your feet, 6 s: players inside regain 5 HP and 3 stamina per second. Initiate rune (Swampland). 40 mana, 20 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Shockwave.name = Rune: Shockwave
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Shockwave.description = Enemies within 4 blocks are knocked back and take 8 damage. On a boss: 3 hits on the defiance bar. Initiate rune (Cliffside). 35 mana, 15 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_FrostGlyph.name = Rune: Frost Glyph
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_FrostGlyph.description = 4-block radius frost disc at the aimed spot (12 blocks), 8 s: enemies inside are slowed by 50%. Initiate rune (Snowblind). 35 mana, 18 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Transfusion.name = Rune: Transfusion
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Transfusion.description = 3 s link to the aimed ally (16 blocks, breaks beyond 20): they gain 10 HP/s, you lose 5/s but never drop below 1 HP. Goes through cage bars. Adept rune (Uncategorized). 30 mana, 15 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Brazier.name = Rune: Mist Brazier
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Brazier.description = 3-block radius flames at the aimed spot, 5 s: 6 damage per second to enemies inside, 3 s burn when leaving. Adept rune (Volcanic). 40 mana, 15 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Daze.name = Rune: Daze
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Daze.description = Aimed enemy within 20 blocks: its current attack is interrupted and it cannot attack for 3 s. On a boss: 2 hits on the defiance bar. Adept rune (Siren's Reef). 30 mana, 12 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Aegis.name = Rune: Mist Aegis
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Aegis.description = You and players within 5 blocks, 8 s: the next direct hit from an enemy is cancelled. Does not stop agony, damage over time, traps or fractal mechanics. Expert rune (Cliffside). 45 mana, 25 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_FrostLine.name = Rune: Frost Line
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_FrostLine.description = 7 × 1 ice barrier across your view, 3 blocks ahead, 8 s: each enemy crossing it is rooted for 1.5 s (once per enemy). Expert rune (Snowblind). 45 mana, 30 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_GravityWell.name = Rune: Gravity Well
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_GravityWell.description = 4-block radius vortex at the aimed spot: after 1.5 s, pulls enemies to the centre and stuns them for 1 s. On a boss: 4 hits on the defiance bar. Expert rune (Solid Ocean). 45 mana, 25 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Decoy.name = Rune: Mist Decoy
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Decoy.description = A double of you (80 HP) at the aimed spot draws enemies within 12 blocks for 6 s. Bosses ignore it. Expert rune (Silent Surf). 40 mana, 30 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Sanctuary.name = Rune: Sanctuary
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Sanctuary.description = 4-block radius dome around you, 5 s: projectiles from ordinary enemies entering it are destroyed (not those of bosses, elites or mechanics). Master rune (Uncategorized). 50 mana, 40 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Reprieve.name = Rune: Reprieve
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Reprieve.description = 10 s: the first player within 6 blocks (yourself included) who would drop to 0 HP stays at 1 HP and takes no damage for 1.5 s. Once per cast. Master rune (Siren's Reef). 50 mana, 60 s cooldown.
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Fear.name = Rune: Fear
items.Rune_Nakasar_Fractal_Fear.description = Enemies within 6 blocks flee from you for 2 s. On a boss: 2 hits on the defiance bar. Master rune (Silent Surf). 40 mana, 20 s cooldown.
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Mending_Staff.name = Mist Mending Staff
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Mending_Staff.description = Attack: each hit heals the most injured player within 8 blocks (yourself included) for 6 HP, at most twice per second. Right click: 6 HP/s regeneration for 3 s on the aimed ally (12 blocks), every 8 s.
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Frost_Grimoire.name = Mist Frost Grimoire
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Frost_Grimoire.description = Attack: each hit slows the enemy by another 10% (5 stacks, 4 s). Right click: 2.5-block radius frost glyph at the aimed spot, 5 s, every 15 s.
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Root_Wand.name = Mist Root Wand
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Root_Wand.description = Attack: a hit roots the enemy for 2 s, once every 8 s per enemy. Right click: 6 × 1 line of vines in front of you, roots for 1 s (2 defiance hits on a boss), every 15 s.
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Banner_Might.name = Mist Banner of Might
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Banner_Might.description = Right click: planted at your feet for 30 s, players within 8 blocks deal 10% more damage. One banner per fractal, every 60 s.
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Banner_Guard.name = Mist Banner of Guard
items.Weapon_Nakasar_Fractal_Banner_Guard.description = Right click: planted at your feet for 30 s, players within 8 blocks take 10% less damage (not agony). One banner per fractal, every 60 s.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Healing_Totem.name = Mist Healing Totem
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Healing_Totem.description = Use: 5-block radius healing zone at your feet, 15 s, +4 HP/s to players. One per fractal: the last one placed replaces the other. Sold by Dessa's Alchemist.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Slowness_Totem.name = Mist Slowness Totem
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Slowness_Totem.description = Use: 5-block radius zone at your feet, 15 s, enemies inside slowed by 40%. One per fractal. Sold by Dessa's Alchemist.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Daze_Bomb.name = Mist Daze Bomb
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Daze_Bomb.description = Throw at the aimed spot (12 blocks): enemies within 3 blocks of the impact are stunned for 2 s (3 defiance hits on a boss). Sold by Dessa's Alchemist.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Smoke_Bomb.name = Mist Smoke Bomb
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Smoke_Bomb.description = Throw at the aimed spot: 4-block radius cloud, 6 s; ordinary enemies inside lose their target. Sold by Dessa's Alchemist.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Purge_Flask.name = Mist Purge Flask
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Purge_Flask.description = Drink (hold right click): removes poison, burn, bleeding, slow and torment, and 2 Hypothermia stacks. Never agony, Corruption or the treasure curse. Sold by Dessa's Alchemist.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Cliffside.name = Echo: Cliffside
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Cliffside.description = A memory of the Cliffside fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Uncategorized.name = Echo: Uncategorized
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Uncategorized.description = A memory of the Uncategorized fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
