items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_SilentSurf.description = A memory of the Silent Surf fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_SirensReef.name = Echo: Siren's Reef
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_SirensReef.description = A memory of the Siren's Reef fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Deepstone.name = Echo: Deepstone
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_Deepstone.description = A memory of the Deepstone fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_SunquaPeak.name = Echo: Sunqua Peak
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Echo_SunquaPeak.description = A memory of the Sunqua Peak fractal, found in its end chest. Ingredient of support runes and weapons, at the Mist Forge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Stable_Core.name = Stable Core
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Stable_Core.description = A Mist shard that does not fade. Master rank end chest only; ingredient of Master runes.
